WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.680
For a meeting or observation, open My documents. No Protocol is required.

2
00:00:06.680 --> 00:00:13.360
Create a document, select Meeting notes and preview its structure.

3
00:00:13.360 --> 00:00:20.280
Confirm the personal destination, visible only to you, then create.

4
00:00:20.280 --> 00:00:30.400
Write observations, decisions and next steps directly in the visual editor.

5
00:00:30.400 --> 00:00:38.600
Wait for Saved. Expand the destination to check ownership and visibility.

6
00:00:38.600 --> 00:00:45.560
Return to the list and search by title to find the document.

7
00:00:45.560 --> 00:00:54.600
Reopen and verify persistence. Create shared work from its project or Lab entry.
